"Yaril is an outsider Declared from Purl, near the second Rapport."
"She has gray eyes and long purple hair crimped from braids."
"Her older brother became a knight four years ago and serves with his squad at Goldbush."
"She passed her oaths at DawnStep and plans her first binding right after Welcome End."
"She promised to message Stu after her first binding."
"Her brother is one of two knights recently gone missing on Goldbush."
